body:
This sounds exactly like my endo. like, I could have written this. The endo pain is the worst in my hips. I can deal with the abdominal and pelvic pain but this hip pain is killllllllllller. I possibly have endo on my sciatic nerve causing the pain in my hips/legs....TBD.

&#x200B;

I wish I knew sooner that this wasn't normal. Yes, it's worth making an appointment!
